# The installer is an artefact, never a committed file: it is ~51 MB, it is rebuilt per release by
# .github/workflows/client-installer.yml, and deploy-hosted.yml would then ship it to the server on every
# deploy. The operator drops it here ON THE SERVER; a tar extract adds files and deletes none, so it survives
# a deploy untouched.
*.exe

# The Android APK (android-in-app-update), uploaded by .github/workflows/android-release.yml as
# APEXA-<version>.apk and served by /api/meta/client-download/android. Never committed, for the same reasons.
*.apk
*.apk.part
